  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">REDD Early Movers Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Payment for achieved policy milestones under the Joint Declaration (Colombia, Norway, UK and Germany) through the REM-partnership. The REM program promotes inclusive natural resource management, particularly at municipal/regional level, as well as strengthened institutional participation of indigenous peoples in decision-making processes. The purpose of climate adaptation is linked, among other things, to to the REM programme&apos;s measures for restoration, forestry and sustainable cattle farming.</narrative>
  </description>
